          <div class="highlights-strip__card" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/highlights/ec-temple-prayer.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" /><p class="highlights-strip__caption">Smoke, prayer, and the weight of something people still believe in</p></div>
