  <section class="route-intro">
  <div class="route-intro__inner">
    <div class="route-intro__rule"></div>

    <p class="route-intro__headline">
      This is our signature route — and it might look like every other China itinerary at first glance.
    </p>

    <div class="route-intro__body">
      <p>
        Shanghai, Suzhou, Hangzhou, Beijing. The same four names you'll find on a dozen tour packages.
        But the way Paris has a thousand tours and only a few that make you fall in love with it —
        the cities aren't what make a trip unforgettable. It's how you move through them, who you're with,
        and the moments no brochure ever mentions.
      </p>
      <span class="route-intro__pivot">This is that version of China.</span>
    </div>

    <div class="route-intro__selector">
      <div class="route-intro__city-list">
        <button class="route-intro__city-item" data-city="0">
          <span class="route-intro__city-name">Shanghai</span>
          <div class="route-intro__dots"><span class="route-intro__dot"></span><span class="route-intro__dot"></span><span class="route-intro__dot"></span></div>
        </button>
        <button class="route-intro__city-item" data-city="1">
          <span class="route-intro__city-name">Suzhou</span>
          <div class="route-intro__dots"><span class="route-intro__dot"></span><span class="route-intro__dot"></span><span class="route-intro__dot"></span></div>
        </button>
        <button class="route-intro__city-item" data-city="2">
          <span class="route-intro__city-name">Hangzhou</span>
          <div class="route-intro__dots"><span class="route-intro__dot"></span><span class="route-intro__dot"></span><span class="route-intro__dot"></span></div>
        </button>
        <button class="route-intro__city-item" data-city="3">
          <span class="route-intro__city-name">Beijing</span>
          <div class="route-intro__dots"><span class="route-intro__dot"></span><span class="route-intro__dot"></span><span class="route-intro__dot"></span></div>
        </button>
      </div>
      <div class="route-intro__city-content">
        <div class="route-intro__city-panel" data-panel="0">
          <p>Shanghai moves like a city that has not decided whether it is finished yet. The Bund is all colonial stone and river fog in the morning; the towers across the water are all glass and light after dark. In between is the French Concession — plane trees lining the sidewalks, a lane house converted to a coffee shop, the smell of rain on stone. You will eat something here that you cannot explain precisely and will think about for weeks afterward.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="route-intro__city-panel" data-panel="1">
          <p>The classical gardens of Suzhou were designed to produce a specific feeling: the sense that you have stepped sideways into a different relationship with time. Water moves through them slowly. The framing of rocks and plants through windows is deliberate — each view is composed. Outside the gardens, the canal streets are narrow and wet-stone and still residential. Old women hang laundry over the water. The canal is working infrastructure, not scenery.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="route-intro__city-panel" data-panel="2">
          <p>West Lake is better at dawn than at any other time — before the tour boats, when the mist is still on the water and the Su Causeway is quiet enough that you can hear the birds. The tea fields above the city are a different kind of quiet: geometric and green and smelling of fresh leaf. In the afternoon the light on the lake is gold. The Song dynasty poets wrote about this and were not exaggerating.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="route-intro__city-panel" data-panel="3">
          <p>Beijing is a city that knows it is the capital. The scale is intentional — the long avenues, the monumental squares, the Forbidden City which is large enough that you cannot see across it. But what stays with you is the hutongs: the lanes behind the drum tower where old Beijing still exists at the pace it always had, where the smell of coal smoke mixes with cooking and someone's radio is playing Peking opera from a window two floors up.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="route-intro__colophon">
      10 days &nbsp;·&nbsp; 4 cities &nbsp;·&nbsp; Zero planning<br>
      All you need is curiosity and a half-empty suitcase.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
(function () {
  const DURATION = 8000;
  const INK_MS   = 1800;
  const selector = document.querySelector('.route-intro__selector');
  if (!selector) return;
  const items  = Array.from(selector.querySelectorAll('.route-intro__city-item'));
  const panels = Array.from(selector.querySelectorAll('.route-intro__city-panel'));
  let current = 0, timer = null, paused = false;

  function rnd(min, max) { return (Math.random() * (max - min) + min).toFixed(1) + '%'; }

  function activate(index) {
    current = index;

    // Instantly hide all panels (remove transition first)
    panels.forEach(p => { p.style.transition = 'none'; p.classList.remove('is-active'); });

    // Reset progress bars
    items.forEach((item, i) => {
      item.classList.toggle('is-active', i === index);
      item.querySelectorAll('.route-intro__dot').forEach(d => {
        d.style.background = i === index ? 'var(--color-red)' : '';
      });
    });

    // Set random origin, inject transition, activate — after a frame so clip snaps to 0 first
    const panel = panels[index];
    panel.style.setProperty('--clip-origin', `${rnd(25, 75)} ${rnd(25, 75)}`);
    requestAnimationFrame(() => {
      panel.style.transition = `clip-path ${INK_MS}ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)`;
      panel.classList.add('is-active');
    });

    clearTimeout(timer);
    if (!paused) timer = setTimeout(() => activate((current + 1) % items.length), DURATION);
  }

  items.forEach((item, i) => item.addEventListener('click', () => { paused = false; activate(i); }));
  selector.addEventListener('mouseenter', () => { paused = true; clearTimeout(timer); });
  selector.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => {
    paused = false;
    timer = setTimeout(() => activate((current + 1) % items.length), DURATION);
  });
  activate(0);
})();
</script>

  <TripWhyUs lang="en" />

  <TripPriceBreakdown lang="en" />

  <section id="itinerary" class="section card tone-sand">
    <h2 class="section-title">10-day route at a glance</h2>
    <p class="section-sub" style="margin-bottom:2rem;">Click any day to explore the places you'll visit.</p>

    <div class="itinerary-accordion">
      {itineraryWithSlides.map((d) => (
        <div class={`itinerary-day${d.isFirstCityDay ? ' itinerary-day--city-start' : ''}`}>
          <button class="itinerary-day__header" data-day-toggle aria-expanded="false">
            <span class="itinerary-day__number">{d.day}</span>
            <span class="itinerary-day__dot"></span>
            <div class="itinerary-day__meta">
              <span class="itinerary-day__city">{d.city}</span>
              <h3 class="itinerary-day__title">{d.title}</h3>
              <p class="itinerary-day__plan">{d.plan}</p>
            </div>
            <span class="itinerary-day__toggle-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
          </button>

          <div class="itinerary-day__body" data-day-body>
            <div class="itinerary-day__body-inner">
              {d.slides.length > 0 && (
                <div class="landmark-carousel">
                  <button class="landmark-carousel__btn landmark-carousel__btn--prev" aria-label="Previous">←</button>
                  <div class="landmark-carousel__track-wrap">
                    <div class="landmark-carousel__track">
                      {d.slides.map((slide) => (
                        <div class="landmark-carousel__slide">
                          {slide.type === 'city' ? (
                            <div class="city-intro-card">
                              <div class="city-intro-card__image">
                                <img src={slide.guide.heroImage} alt={slide.guide.heroAlt} loading="lazy" />
                              </div>
                              <div class="city-intro-card__content">
                                <span class="city-intro-card__label">City overview</span>
                                <h3 class="city-intro-card__city">{slide.guide.city}</h3>
                                <p class="city-intro-card__desc">{slide.guide.context}</p>
                              </div>
                            </div>
                          ) : (
                            <div class="landmark-card">
                              <div class="landmark-card__visual">
                                <img src={slide.lm.image} alt={slide.lm.name} loading="lazy" />
                              </div>
                              <div class="landmark-card__base-overlay"></div>
                              <div class="landmark-card__name-overlay">
                                <p class="landmark-card__name">{slide.lm.name}</p>
                                <p class="landmark-card__name-zh">{slide.lm.nameZh}</p>
                              </div>
                              <div class="landmark-card__overlay"></div>
                              <div class="landmark-card__body">
                                <p class="landmark-card__body-name">{slide.lm.name}</p>
                                <p class="landmark-card__body-name-zh">{slide.lm.nameZh}</p>
                                <p class="landmark-card__background">{slide.lm.background}</p>
                              </div>
                            </div>
                          )}
                        </div>
                      ))}
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <button class="landmark-carousel__btn landmark-carousel__btn--next" aria-label="Next">→</button>
                </div>
              )}
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section incl-grid">
    <article class="incl-card incl-card--yes">
      <h2 class="incl-card__title">Included</h2>
      <ul class="incl-list">
        {included.map((item) => (
          <li class="incl-item"><i class="incl-icon incl-icon--yes">✓</i><span>{item}</span></li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </article>
    <article class="incl-card incl-card--no">
      <h2 class="incl-card__title">Not included</h2>
      <ul class="incl-list">
        {notIncluded.map((item) => (
          <li class="incl-item"><i class="incl-icon incl-icon--no">×</i><span>{item}</span></li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="section card tone-blue">
    <h2 class="section-title">Video references before you decide</h2>
    <div class="grid cols-3 video-grid">
      {recommendedVideos.map((video) => {
        const ytId = video.url.match(/[?&]v=([^&]+)/)?.[1] || '';
        return (
          <a href={video.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="video-card">
            <div class="video-card__thumb">
              <img src={`https://img.youtube.com/vi/${ytId}/hqdefault.jpg`} alt={video.title} loading="lazy" />
              <div class="video-card__play">
                <svg width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none"><circle cx="24" cy="24" r="24" fill="rgba(0,0,0,0.6)"/><path d="M19 15l14 9-14 9V15z" fill="#fff"/></svg>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="video-card__info">
              <h3 class="video-card__title">{video.title}</h3>
              <p class="video-card__creator">{video.creator}</p>
              <p class="video-card__note">{video.note}</p>
            </div>
          </a>
        );
      })}
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SEO context — visually subtle, content-rich for search engines -->
  <section class="section" style="padding: 1.5rem 2rem 0;">
    <div style="max-width:54rem; margin:0 auto; border-top:1px solid #e8e5e0; padding-top:1.5rem;">
      <p style="font-size:13px; line-height:1.9; color:#9a9590; text-align:center;">Planning a China trip from Toronto or elsewhere in Canada? Start with the <a href="/handbook" style="color:#b8524a;">handbook</a>, then check the <a href="/about" style="color:#b8524a;">team background</a> and <a href="/privacy" style="color:#b8524a;">privacy policy</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="faq" class="faq">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <p class="section-eyebrow">FAQ</p>
        <h2 class="section-title">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="faq__list">
        {faq.map((f, i) => (
          <div class="faq__item" id={`trip-faq-${i}`}>
            <button class="faq__q" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls={`trip-faq-answer-${i}`}>
              <span>{f.q}</span>
              <svg class="faq__icon" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="M5 7.5L10 12.5L15 7.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
            </button>
            <div class="faq__a" id={`trip-faq-answer-${i}`} role="region" aria-labelledby={`trip-faq-${i}`}>
              <div class="faq__a-inner">{f.a}</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="apply" class="route-apply">
    <div class="container" style="text-align:center; padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0;">
      <p class="section-eyebrow" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);">Apply</p>
      <h2 class="section-title" style="color:#fff; margin-bottom:1rem;">Ready to go?</h2>
      <p style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.72); font-size:clamp(0.95rem,2vw,1.05rem); line-height:1.75; max-width:460px; margin:0 auto 2rem;">
        Tell us about yourself and which trip you're interested in — we'll follow up within 5 business days.
      </p>
      <a href="/apply"
        style="display:inline-block; background:var(--color-red,#c8102e); color:#fff; padding:0.9rem 2.5rem; font-size:0.875rem; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:0.08em; text-decoration:none; text-transform:uppercase; transition:background 0.2s;"
        onmouseover="this.style.background='#a00d24'"
        onmouseout="this.style.background='var(--color-red,#c8102e)'">
        Apply Now →
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
.trip-hero {
  position: relative;
  height: clamp(480px, 65vh, 720px);
  overflow: hidden;
}
.trip-hero__img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  object-fit: cover;
  object-position: center;
}
.trip-hero__overlay {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.15) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0.55) 100%);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: flex-end;
  padding: 2.5rem;
  text-align: center;
}
.trip-hero__title {
  color: #fff;
  font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  line-height: 1.1;
  margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
}
.trip-hero__sub {
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
  font-size: 1.1rem;
  max-width: 640px;
  line-height: 1.7;
}
</style>

<script is:inline>
// ── FAQ accordion ──────────────────────────────────────
document.querySelectorAll('.faq__item').forEach(item => {
  const btn = item.querySelector('.faq__q');
  const answer = item.querySelector('.faq__a');
  btn?.addEventListener('click', () => {
    const open = item.classList.toggle('is-open');
    btn.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(open));
    if (answer) answer.style.maxHeight = open ? answer.scrollHeight + 'px' : '0';
  });
});

// ── Itinerary day accordion ────────────────────────────
document.querySelectorAll('[data-day-toggle]').forEach(btn => {
  const body = btn.nextElementSibling;
  if (!body) return;
  btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
    const isOpen = btn.getAttribute('aria-expanded') === 'true';
    btn.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(!isOpen));
    body.classList.toggle('is-open', !isOpen);
  });
});

// ── Highlights marquee (JS rAF — works in Safari) ──────
(function () {
  if (window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches) return;

  document.querySelectorAll('.highlights-strip__stage').forEach(function (stage) {
    var rows = stage.querySelectorAll('.highlights-strip__row');

    rows.forEach(function (row, i) {
      var track = row.querySelector('.highlights-strip__track');
      if (!track) return;

      // Measure set width from original (non-clone) cards
      var originals = track.querySelectorAll('.highlights-strip__card:not([aria-hidden="true"])');
      if (!originals.length) return;
      var cardW = originals[0].offsetWidth; // 240px from CSS flex basis
      var gap = 12; // matches CSS gap: 12px
      var setWidth = originals.length * (cardW + gap); // 9 * 252 = 2268px

      // Row 0 → left (-speed), Row 1 → right (+speed)
      var isRight = (i === 1);
      var speed = isRight ? 0.45 : 0.55;
      var pos = isRight ? -setWidth : 0;
      var paused = false;

      // Hover: pause this row only
      row.addEventListener('mouseenter', function () { paused = true; });
      row.addEventListener('mouseleave', function () { paused = false; });

      // Mobile tap: toggle caption on card
      row.addEventListener('click', function (e) {
        var card = e.target.closest('.highlights-strip__card');
        var allCards = stage.querySelectorAll('.highlights-strip__card');
        if (card) {
          var wasActive = card.classList.contains('is-active');
          allCards.forEach(function (c) { c.classList.remove('is-active'); });
          if (!wasActive) { card.classList.add('is-active'); paused = true; }
          else { paused = false; }
        } else {
          allCards.forEach(function (c) { c.classList.remove('is-active'); });
          paused = false;
        }
      });

      // Set initial position immediately (row 2 starts at -setWidth)
      track.style.transform = 'translate3d(' + pos + 'px, 0, 0)';

      function tick() {
        if (!paused) {
          pos += isRight ? speed : -speed;
          if (!isRight && pos <= -setWidth) pos += setWidth;
          if (isRight  && pos >= 0)         pos  = -setWidth;
          track.style.transform = 'translate3d(' + pos + 'px, 0, 0)';
        }
        requestAnimationFrame(tick);
      }
      requestAnimationFrame(tick);
    });
  });
}());

// ── Landmark carousels ─────────────────────────────────
document.querySelectorAll('.landmark-carousel').forEach(carousel => {
  const track = carousel.querySelector('.landmark-carousel__track');
  const slides = carousel.querySelectorAll('.landmark-carousel__slide');
  const prevBtn = carousel.querySelector('.landmark-carousel__btn--prev');
  const nextBtn = carousel.querySelector('.landmark-carousel__btn--next');
  if (!track || slides.length === 0) return;

  let current = 0;
  const total = slides.length;

  function goTo(n) {
    current = Math.max(0, Math.min(n, total - 1));
    const slideWidth = slides[0].offsetWidth + 16;
    track.style.transform = `translateX(-${current * slideWidth}px)`;
  }

  prevBtn?.addEventListener('click', () => goTo(current - 1));
  nextBtn?.addEventListener('click', () => goTo(current + 1));

  let touchX = 0;
  carousel.addEventListener('touchstart', e => { touchX = e.touches[0].clientX; }, { passive: true });
  carousel.addEventListener('touchend', e => {
    const delta = touchX - e.changedTouches[0].clientX;
    if (Math.abs(delta) > 40) goTo(current + (delta > 0 ? 1 : -1));
  });
});
</script>
